<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Tolo Ginto - Accra</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial;margin:0;background:#f8f8f8}
.header{background:#111;color:#fff;padding:40px 20px;text-align:center}
.container{padding:20px;max-width:700px;margin:auto}
.card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin:15px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.btn{display:block;background:#25D366;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:16px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px}
.btn2{background:#111;margin-top:10px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
<h1>TOLO GINTO</h1>
<p>Quality Wears | Accra, Ghana | Nationwide Delivery</p>
</div>
<div class="container">
<div class="card">
<h2>Welcome to Tolo Ginto</h2>
<p>Quality thrift & new wears for Men, Ladies, Kids. Affordable prices. Fast delivery.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/233000000000">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>Our Products</h2>
<p>Men's Wear<br>Ladies' Wear<br>Shoes & Sneakers<br>Bags & Accessories</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>How to Order</h2>
<p>1. Screenshot what you like<br>2. Chat us on WhatsApp<br>3. We deliver: Accra same day, other regions 24-48hrs<br>4. Pay with MoMo or Cash on Delivery</p>
<a class="btn btn2" href="https://wa.me/233000000000">Order Now</a>
</div>
<div class="card" style="text-align:center">
Accra, Ghana<br>We deliver everywhere in Ghana<br><br>2026 Tolo Ginto
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
